# Doubling Season's "if an effect would put one or more counters on a permanent you control": a planeswalker's printed loyalty is
# an intrinsic ability that it enters with (CR 306.5b, 614.1c), an effect, so Jace, Wielder of Mysteries enters with 4 x 2 = 8
# loyalty counters (the ruling). Its +1 puts one loyalty counter on it as the ability's cost (CR 606.4, 118.3), which is no
# effect, so it is not doubled (the ruling): Jace has 9. (Doubling the cost too would make 10; not doubling the entry, 5.)

